        "TileImage": "$($repository 93aeb20f-58d8-40c6-84e6-7211290f2088).Image",
        "Description": "All the information we have gathered leads up to this moment. We have tracked down where the launch code for a missile which once detonated will turn the whole world into homosexuals, the launch code has 4 digits which is split between 4 special agents who are the only ones who know about the code. You are tasked with killing and retrieving the slips of paper with the digits written on them, they are planning on launching today so make it quick. Good luck 47, the world is now in your hands.",
